  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童DIY插珠帐篷拼搭套装",
    "en": "Kids DIY Fort Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款儿童DIY插珠帐篷拼搭套装，采用PP结构件，适用于家庭互动、课堂活动和启蒙拼搭场景。\n\n产品定位于4-6岁儿童，支持拆装重构，可用于创意搭建与手眼协调训练。",
    "en": "This is a kids DIY bead-and-rod fort building set made with PP structural parts, suitable for family interaction, classroom activities, and early construction play scenarios.\n\nIt is positioned for ages 4-6 and supports repeated assembly and reconfiguration for creative building and hand-eye coordination practice."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童DIY插珠帐篷拼搭套装以模块化拼接结构为核心，可搭建帐篷、通道和互动空间等多种形态，适合持续创意构建。",
      "产品适用于亲子互动、课堂教具和活动场景，支持反复拆装，可用于智力开发、动手能力与协作玩法训练。",
      "包装为彩盒，配套体积和尺寸参数完整，便于渠道上架、仓配管理与项目采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids DIY fort building set uses a modular interlocking structure and supports multiple forms such as tents, tunnels, and interactive spaces for continuous creative construction play.",
      "It is suitable for parent-child interaction, classroom props, and activity scenarios, with repeatable assembly for cognitive development, hands-on skills, and collaborative play.",
      "The set uses color-box packaging and provides complete volume and size data for channel listing, warehouse operations, and project procurement."
    ]
  },
